hakios-devices-lynx

Several licenses apply, by directory:

1. drivers/ and xnu/ are a derivative work of Apple's XNU and of the HakiOS kernel drivers and are licensed
   under the Apple Public Source License, Version 2.0 (the full text is LICENSE.APSL of the HakiOS repository,
   https://github.com/oosexgang/hakios-xnu-kernel).

2. lynxld/acpm/ and lynxld/usb/ come from PixOS (https://github.com/PixOS-Project/pixelios-kernel): MIT,
   Copyright (c) 2026 PixOS-Project contributors; the text is LICENSE.PixOS-MIT in each of the two directories.

3. probes/gs201_cal.h reproduces the PCIe PHY calibration of Google's kernel/gs
   (drivers/pci/controller/dwc/pcie-exynos-gs201-rc-cal.c, Copyright Samsung Electronics Co., Ltd.):
   GPL-2.0-only. probes/pcieprobe.c includes it and is GPL-2.0-only as well.

4. Everything else (the loader in lynxld/, the other probes, the tools, the device layer, the documentation)
   is licensed under the MIT License below.

The phone's firmware, Android's boot image and kernel, and Apple's operating system are not part of this
repository and are not licensed by it (LEGAL.md).

